{"title":"Jadhav Quadratic Formula","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Jadhav Quadratic Formula</b> finds all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for a given value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />. It is named after <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jyotiraditya_Jadhav&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Jyotiraditya Jadhav (page does not exist)\">Jyotiraditya Jadhav</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Statement\">Statement</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jadhav_Quadratic_Formula&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Statement\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any given value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84cea4f7bfc5284747e737af0d1a25e64afdd47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />, we can find its respective values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2bd337b7c8987c2fb4fa9e42598473940edf6aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2-4a(c-y)}}{2a}\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Derivation\">Derivation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jadhav_Quadratic_Formula&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Derivation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We have the quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bfd4e3ff4c23ea0454342bfdc98443effb2e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />, which can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d4e6aa12e5f56e2a53420b7f1aa130e5bd711fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+(c-y) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"21\" />. From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/5/e8513d76f2faa455978f1363a1b7a23d84b7bb0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2-4a(c-y)}}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"212\" height=\"43\" />, as desired.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jadhav_Quadratic_Formula&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">Quadratic equation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_Formula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic Formula\">Quadratic Formula</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Jadhav_Quadratic_Formula&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018092045\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1820/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.512      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.512      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21480:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018092045 and revision id 292185. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}